<!--
  The notification silhouette for anything about a friend.

  Android tints notification icons to a flat white and drops any colour, so this
  is drawn as one opaque path with generous negative space: a head and shoulders
  that stay readable at 24 dp in the status bar, where a finer drawing would
  close up into a blob.
-->
